# "Upstairs Downstairs" (levels/duo/d1.txt), the double game's first level, the Giant Steps
# route (the hard line, the best nuggets, the blind jump). For
# `NATHAN_DUO=1 scripts/record-run --capture out.mp4 scripts/tours/duo-1.timeline duo` and
# tests/duo.rs. Nat up top, Han running down below; the window follows Han.
# The opening: Nat lands up top, Han falls on through to the cellar. Hops, the wobbly bridge,
# the sewage, something every few steps.
t=0.1 press Right
t=0.9 tap Space 150ms
t=2.1 tap Space 120ms
t=3.72 tap Space 200ms
t=4.30 tap Space 200ms
t=5.00 tap Space 200ms
t=5.80 tap Space 200ms
# The swap: stop on the trapdoor and drop into the cellar (Han rides his vent up), over the
# crumbling stones.
t=7.88 release Right
t=8.55 press Right
t=9.30 tap Space 150ms
t=9.60 tap Space 200ms
t=9.85 tap Space 150ms
t=10.10 tap Space 200ms
t=10.10 tap Space 300ms
t=10.40 tap Space 150ms
t=10.70 tap Space 200ms
t=10.70 tap Space 250ms
t=11.20 tap Space 150ms
# The crossing: up the stairs, jump and toot up through the hole Han just fell down.
t=12.90 tap Space 150ms
t=13.20 tap Space 150ms
t=13.50 tap Space 150ms
t=14.10 tap Space 200ms
t=14.34 tap Space 150ms
t=14.80 tap Space 200ms
# Four quick nuggets: fired up's charged. Down calls it, for Han's pit.
t=16.10 tap Down
# Fired up: over the stones, the sewage, the spikes.
t=17.00 tap Space 300ms
t=17.50 tap Space 150ms
t=17.92 tap Space 150ms
t=18.55 tap Space 200ms
t=19.20 tap Space 200ms
t=19.60 tap Space 200ms
t=20.00 tap Space 200ms
# The band fork: five toots over the pits and the hurdle charge Giant Steps (filled last, so
# it's the call). Down: it lands as Han reaches the fork's vent, and he floats upstairs.
t=21.84 tap Space 150ms
t=22.06 tap Space 120ms
t=22.70 tap Space 150ms
t=22.92 tap Space 120ms
t=23.30 tap Space 150ms
t=23.52 tap Space 120ms
t=23.70 tap Down
# Giant Steps: the hurdle, then stop on the trapdoor and drop into the cellar Han left.
t=24.92 tap Space 200ms
t=29.40 release Right
t=30.00 press Right
# Down below: the hurdle, the pit's stone, onto the ledge Han ran under (the best nuggets).
t=30.75 tap Space 200ms
t=32.78 tap Space 200ms
t=33.38 tap Space 200ms
t=34.45 tap Space 300ms
t=34.85 tap Space 150ms
t=35.73 tap Space 100ms
t=36.91 tap Space 100ms
# The merge: up the stairs, jump and toot through the hole as Han drops down it.
t=39.13 tap Space 150ms
t=39.53 tap Space 150ms
t=39.93 tap Space 150ms
t=40.89 tap Space 200ms
t=41.15 tap Space 150ms
# The nerve fork: hop the hole (the long way down) and jump blind behind the bandstand:
# a hidden stone, then out.
t=43.01 tap Space 300ms
t=44.03 tap Space 250ms
t=45.05 tap Space 250ms
# The shout chorus: over the shelf, the bridge, the sewage, the hurdle, the spikes, then down
# to Han and the plunger together.
t=47.05 tap Space 300ms
t=48.70 tap Space 200ms
t=49.93 tap Space 150ms
t=51.93 tap Space 250ms
t=53.48 tap Space 200ms
t=54.80 tap Space 200ms
t=55.18 tap Space 200ms
t=57.55 tap Space 200ms
at 64
